{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/605d93420e9d48be5c6a8d25e6c5da75.avif?t=1758124782\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the creator of <i>THE CORRIDOR</i> comes<strong> It Takes a War</strong>\u00a0- a team-based shooter with <strong>VISCERAL</strong> gunplay and <strong>RELENTLESS</strong> action. Throw yourself into <strong>RELENTLESSLY VISCERAL</strong> combat where survival is entirely dependent on communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no 'i' in 'team', but there is in <strong>VICTORY</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/19ce5bad0462bdfae97a78827714a358.avif?t=1758124782\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A devastatingly real depiction of the battlefield. You won't believe your eyes (or ears)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/cf36edb96ace4262adfa100cccdf7191.avif?t=1758124782\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Define your playstyle via one of three totally unique combat classes - play <i>your</i> way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/f1a1a404e722bc29333a042af98ddcc8.avif?t=1758124782\" width=800 height=103 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary 'Voice Chat' allows you to connect with your team in real-time, sharing intel and strategies on the fly. OVER!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/7c0c4bb8754d75352d7bd337a291a041.avif?t=1758124782\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ultra Realism</strong> - cutting edge graphics will transport you to the frontlines of battle... and beyond!\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic weapons</strong> - take down a well-armed foe with an assortment of very nice and very real-looking guns!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is key </strong>- connect with your team in real-time via 'Voice Chat'!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Combat</strong> - absolutely nothing under the surface to distract from VISCERAL TACTICAL ACTION!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/extras/f57fa2a2517298d9b96e5ee7b316865a.avif?t=1758124782\" width=800 height=103 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: No generative AI was used in the making of this game or its associated assets.</i></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3919530?t=1758124782","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/861da3c14e7bfba97ab425bdadf4d68f30a056a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758124782","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3919530/cf20759d726d4547ce89c8f6ac8f94deab045905/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758124782","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st